      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Hysingla ER, the second single-ingredient extended-release hydrocodone product to become available in the US, is formulated for once-daily use. Zohydro ER is dosed twice daily and costs more. Both Hysingla ER and the new formulation of Zohydro ER have abuse-deterrent properties, but they will still be subject to misuse."},
